#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:5
msgid "Invoicing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:8
msgid "On this page:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:11
msgid "Create an invoice that can be paid using Taler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:13
msgid ""
"It is possible to create an invoice that includes a Taler QR Code to pay "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:16 ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:59
msgid "Go to the Invoicing app and create a new invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:17
msgid "Fill any data relevant to the invoice that you are creating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:18
msgid ""
"Important step: In the ``Other Info`` tab, set the Payment Method to "
"``Taler`` (see below). Otherwise, the QR Code will not be generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid "Taler invoices payment method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_invoices_payment_method.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_invoices_payment_method.png"

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:26
msgid ""
"When you are done, click ``Confirm`` at the top, you will be led to the "
"invoice page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can now click ``Preview`` to see the Invoice that will be sent to "
"your customer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:31
msgid ""
"The invoice’s PDF will include a Taler payment QR Code, as well as some "
"Taler order information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid "Taler invoices taler qr code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_invoices_taler_qr_code.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_invoices_taler_qr_code.png"

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:39
msgid ""
"If a customer pays for the invoice using the QR Code present in the PDF, "
"you will have to do a manual payment reconciliation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:42
msgid ""
"To do this, once you confirm that you received the payment, go to the "
"Invoices’ app page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:44
msgid "Click on ``Pay``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:45
msgid ""
"Confirm the data shown in the opened window, it is recommended to add the"
" Taler OrderID shown on the invoice, to the ``Memo`` field, to keep track"
" of the payment more easily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:48
msgid "Press ``Create Payment``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:53
msgid "Pay an invoice online using Taler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:56
msgid ""
"This process is unrelated to the invoices created with Taler in the "
"previous step Any invoice can be paid online using Taler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once created, you can press ``Preview`` to see the page that the customer"
" will see."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:62
msgid ""
"On this page, the user will be able to click ``Pay Now``, and choose "
"Taler as a payment option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid "Taler invoices online payment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_invoices_online_payment.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_invoices_online_payment.png"

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:70
msgid ""
"Once they click ``Pay``, they will be redirected to the Taler order page,"
" where they can pay with a Taler wallet on their phone or web browser (in"
" the same way as for an eCommerce payment)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:73
msgid ""
"When the payment is complete, the customer will be sent back to the "
"invoice page, with a notice saying that the payment is successful."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid "Taler invoices paid online"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/invoicing.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_invoices_paid_online.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_invoices_paid_online.png"

